        "content": "## Review sentiment\n\nReads up to 25 sheet rows that have ReviewText and ReviewId and an empty Sentiment cell.\n\nHeaders: ReviewId, Product, ReviewText, Sentiment, Strength, Confidence, ReviewedAt.\n\nNegative reviews are also posted to Slack. The sheet update uses ReviewId as the match key, so do not leave it blank.",
